flowchart TD
    Start([Core Bank Verifies Banking OTP]) --> PushWebhook[POST /api/integration/transaction-context/\nDummy Bank -> PayShield]
    PushWebhook --> AuthHeader{Valid X-Dummy-Bank-Token?}
    AuthHeader -- No --> Reject401[401 Unauthorized]
    AuthHeader -- Yes --> ResolveUser[Resolve LinkedBankAccount -> PayShieldUser]
    ResolveUser --> CreateApproval[Create ApprovalRequest: status PENDING, timer 60s]
    CreateApproval --> DispatchPush[Send High-Priority Push to Active Device via Expo/FCM]
    DispatchPush --> UserNotification([User Phone Vibrates / Displays Banner])

    UserNotification --> OpenApp[Customer Opens PayShield App]
    OpenApp --> LoadApproval[Fetch Pending Request: Recipient, Amount, Masked Acc]
    LoadApproval --> UserChoice{Customer Decision}

    UserChoice -- User Taps APPROVE --> AtomicLockApprove[Atomic select_for_update Row Lock]
    AtomicLockApprove --> CheckExpiredA{Is timer expired?}
    CheckExpiredA -- Yes --> MarkExpiredA[Mark EXPIRED -> Inform Bank Cancelled]
    CheckExpiredA -- No --> CallBankApprove[POST /api/transactions/decision/ -> APPROVED]
    CallBankApprove --> CompleteTx[Dummy Bank Debits Funds & Completes Tx]

    UserChoice -- User Taps DENY --> AtomicLockDeny[Atomic select_for_update Row Lock]
    AtomicLockDeny --> CallBankDeny[POST /api/transactions/decision/ -> DENIED]
    CallBankDeny --> CancelTx[Dummy Bank Aborts Tx & Releases Hold]
    CancelTx --> AskScam{Report Cyber Crime?}
    AskScam -- Yes --> SubmitIncident[POST /api/approvals/id/report-fraud/]
    SubmitIncident --> ReturnNCR[Issue NCR-2026-XXXXXX Ref & 1930 Helpline Info]
    AskScam -- No --> EndDone([Transaction Safeguarded])

    UserChoice -- No Action within 60s --> LazyReconcile[Auto-Expiry Reconciler]
    LazyReconcile --> CallBankExpire[POST /api/transactions/decision/ -> EXPIRED]
    CallBankExpire --> CancelTx
